==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{m|fro|sacrestie}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|sacristia}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sacristies}}

# A [[room]] in a [[church]] where sacred vessels, books, [[vestment]]s, etc. are kept. Sometimes also used by [[clergy]] to prepare for worship or for meetings.

